# 独立市场 Pages 构建配置示例，不是主站 .env；构建入口不会自动加载此文件。
# Dedicated catalog Pages build example, not the main-site .env; the build does not load this file.
# 普通构建变量以 wrangler.jsonc 的 vars 为唯一来源；控制台仅配置 GITHUB_TOKEN 机密。
# Non-secret build variables come from wrangler.jsonc vars; configure only the GITHUB_TOKEN secret in the dashboard.
# 下方普通变量仅对应当前配置，修改本示例不会生效；修改正式配置须同步 wrangler.jsonc。
# The non-secret values below mirror the current configuration; editing this example has no effect. Update wrangler.jsonc.
# 此地址用于恢复正式市场索引，不是主站地址。
# This URL restores the production catalog, not the main site.
# 使用实际分配的市场正式域名，不得填入主站、预览地址或 catalog-index.json 文件路径。
# Use the actual production catalog domain, never the main site, a preview URL, or a catalog-index.json file path.
CATALOG_PUBLIC_URL=https://marketplace-catalog.pages.dev

# 只读 GitHub Token，仅用于公开仓库的 GitHub API；不授予仓库写入权限。
# Read-only GitHub token for public-repository API access; do not grant repository write permissions.
# 必须在市场 Pages 的对应 Production 或 Preview 环境保存为机密，不能选择“文本”。
# Save it as a secret in the catalog Pages project's matching Production or Preview environment, not as Text.
# 不得写入 wrangler.jsonc 的 vars、构建命令、Git 或静态产物，也不得添加 VITE_ 前缀。
# Never place it in wrangler.jsonc vars, the build command, Git, or static output; never add a VITE_ prefix.
# 已在截图或日志暴露的 Token 必须先撤销，再配置新 Token；仅改变变量类型不足以恢复安全。
# Revoke a token exposed in screenshots or logs before saving a new token; changing its variable type is not enough.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 关闭平台自动安装，只安装独立市场仓库锁定的依赖，避免重复安装。
# Skip automatic installation; install only this catalog repository's locked dependencies once.
# 在 wrangler.jsonc 的 vars 中以字符串 "1" 配置，不依赖控制台同名文本变量。
# Set it to the string "1" in wrangler.jsonc vars, not a same-named dashboard text variable.
SKIP_DEPENDENCY_INSTALL=1

# 同日已发布且协议兼容时跳过采集；true 仅供用户明确要求的单次强制构建。
# Reuse a compatible published batch from the same day; true is for a deliberate one-off rebuild.
# 在 wrangler.jsonc 的 vars 中以字符串 "false" 或 "true" 配置，不使用 JSON 布尔值。
# Use the string "false" or "true" in wrangler.jsonc vars, not a JSON boolean.
CATALOG_FORCE=false

# 仅当确认市场从未成功正式部署时，临时使用 CATALOG_INITIAL_BUILD=true；未设置默认关闭。
# Temporarily use CATALOG_INITIAL_BUILD=true only after confirming no successful production deployment; unset means disabled.
# 开关只接受字符串 true 或 false，不能使用空值；它不是 CATALOG_FORCE，也不会跳过全部恢复错误。
# Only the strings true and false are accepted, never an empty value; this is not CATALOG_FORCE and does not bypass all restore errors.
# 首次模式仅允许顶层 catalog-index.json 的 HTTP 522 进入采集；其他网络或协议错误仍失败。
# Initial mode only permits HTTP 522 for the top-level catalog-index.json to start collection; other network or protocol errors still fail.
# 已有合法生产索引时会拒绝初始化；首次必须完成全部 Skills 声明范围和两个 MCP 的批准窗口。
# Initialization is rejected when a valid production index exists; all Skills discovery scopes and both approved MCP windows must succeed.
# MCP 每个来源最多五页：官方 Registry 每页 100 条，ModelScope 每页 30 条；仍有后续结果时标为 partial。
# Each MCP source reads at most five pages: 100 records per Registry page and 30 per ModelScope page; remaining results are marked partial.
# 窗口内任何请求或协议错误仍失败，不能把失败候选、历史保留数据或未知总数伪装成成功全量。
# Request/protocol failures inside the window still fail; failed candidates, retained history and unknown totals are never exhaustive success.
# 主站公共契约、浏览契约和覆盖提示必须先同步编译部署，再发布带 partial 状态的市场目录。
# Compile and deploy the compatible main-site contracts and coverage UI before publishing a catalog with partial coverage.
# 共享静态缓存和同日生产批次复用沿用现状；冷构建仍要读取各个 SKILL.md，不保证失败检查点跨构建保留。
# Existing shared static caches and same-day published-batch reuse remain; cold builds read each SKILL.md and failed checkpoints are not durable.
# 不要把开关写入长期 wrangler.jsonc 配置或长期控制台变量，仅临时调整首次构建命令。
# Do not persist this flag in wrangler.jsonc or dashboard variables; use it only in the temporary first-build command.
# 首次构建命令 / Initial build command: npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund && CATALOG_INITIAL_BUILD=true npm run build
# 首次正式部署成功后立即恢复下方正常构建命令；以后生产故障不能重新启用首次模式。
# Immediately restore the normal build command below after the first successful production deployment; never re-enable initial mode for production outages.
# 初始化仅准备首批候选产物，不代表生产已成功发布；仍须核对实际 Pages 部署结果。
# Initialization only prepares the first candidate artifacts; it does not prove production publication. Verify the actual Pages deployment.

# Pages 项目连接完整的独立市场仓库，名称与本目录 wrangler.jsonc 的 name 一致。
# Connect the complete standalone catalog repository and match the name in this directory's wrangler.jsonc.
# 构建所需核心已纳入 core/；与主站同名模块同步规则时须同步核心快照。
# Required core modules live in core/; update this snapshot when synchronizing rules with the main site.
# 原生 Node 通过显式 .ts 引用加载仓库内模块，不需要自定义解析器或主站 app/。
# Native Node loads local modules through explicit .ts imports, without a custom resolver or the main site's app/.
# 框架预设 / Framework preset: 无 / None
# 独立仓库根目录留空，不要填写 marketplace-catalog 子目录。
# Leave the standalone repository's root directory blank, not marketplace-catalog.
# 构建命令 / Build command: npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund && npm run build
# 输出目录 / Build output directory: dist
# Node 版本由 .node-version 固定；禁止设置 CATALOG_OUTPUT 改写工作目录。
# Node is pinned in .node-version; do not set CATALOG_OUTPUT to override the workspace.
# 禁止上传 output、源码、Functions 或主站构建；仅发布已校验的 dist。
# Publish only validated dist, never output, sources, Functions, or the main-site build.
#
# 采集、恢复、验证共用 15 分钟预算；安装与平台发布需计入完整的 20 分钟验收。
# Collection, restore, and validation share 15 minutes; include install and deployment in the 20-minute acceptance check.
# 全批最多 6000 请求、256 MiB 网络数据；公开产物最多 15000 文件、256 MiB。
# Per run: at most 6000 requests and 256 MiB transferred; output: at most 15000 files and 256 MiB.
# 生产版本与最多七个历史版本先去重预估再恢复；超预算失败，不自动删减来源或历史。
# Deduplicate and preflight production plus up to seven historical versions; fail over budget without silently dropping sources or history.
# 未发布检查点不保证跨失败构建保留；并发 Hook 不保证严格只执行一次。
# Unpublished checkpoints are not durable across failed builds; concurrent hooks are not exactly-once.
#
# build 成功仅表示产物准备完成；实际发布成功必须核对 Pages 部署记录及正式索引。
# A successful build only prepares artifacts; confirm deployment in Pages and the production index.
# 主站验收后设置 VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_* 并构建一次；之后日更不需要主站重新构建。
# After acceptance, set the main site's VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_* and rebuild it once; daily updates need no main-site rebuild.
# 主站 VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_URL 同样指向上述正式市场地址，不是主站自身地址。
# The main site's VITE_PUBLIC_CATALOG_URL points to the same production catalog URL, not the main site itself.
# 调度器单独部署，Secret 与 Cron 说明见 scheduler/.dev.vars.example。
# Deploy the scheduler separately; see scheduler/.dev.vars.example for its secret and Cron setup.
# 旧 Actions 与 publish.ts 保留至新链路上线验收，不要提前删除。
# Keep the old Actions workflow and publish.ts until the new delivery path passes acceptance.
